    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if i just take some high dose oregano oil and some turmeric instead? i've read that they can be super strong against bacteria. i'm just worried about my gut health if i take antibiotics so soon. surely if i'm being really aggressive with the natural stuff i can hold off on the doctor for a little bit longer?",
